WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:00.940
(Episode 101) You just leave after sex with me.

2
00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.480
You don't acknowledge me when you're done, huh?

3
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.140
Isn't this what I learned from you?

4
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.020
Why didn't you tell me about your return?

5
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.380
You already have a new love.

6
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.600
Why should I tell you?

7
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.440
I have a new love?

8
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.000
What?

9
00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.800
Your new love is waiting for you.

10
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:20.720
Scarlett.

11
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.960
What a coincidence to see you two.

12
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.120
Oh, Miss Hall, don't misunderstand.

13
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.160
I just happened to meet Mr. Bradley.

14
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.940
We're not in that relationship.

15
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.980
It's alright, he and I are just cousins.

16
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.820
Niko, didn't you say that you were waiting

17
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.140
for my cousin-in-law to remarry you?

18
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.500
What?

19
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:37.960
Cousin?

20
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:39.800
You and...

21
00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:41.760
Scarlett really is my cousin.

22
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.880
But I saw it in the news that...

23
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.560
Entertainment news is all lies.

24
00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.680
I was doing fashion shows in France before.

25
00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.480
I just returned to the country and have no
resources,

26
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.920
so I begged my cousin

27
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.300
for some help.

28
00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.400
Just because you read some entertainment news,

29
00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.700
you believe that there is something going on

30
00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:58.520
between Scarlett and me?

31
00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.320
Ah,

32
00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.340
Noemi, you

33
00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.820
take entertainment news seriously?

34
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.800
No wonder you were hostile to me last night.

35
00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:06.800
Noemi,

36
00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.540
you just don't trust me, do you?

37
00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.420
I didn't mean to.

38
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.740
Besides, you didn't trust me before.

39
00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.800
Well, I'll leave you guys alone.

40
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:23.900
The first time I met your cousin,

41
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.160
I embarrassed myself like this.

42
00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:27.460
Niko,

43
00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.820
I won't be able to face anyone in the future.

44
00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.960
I'll take you home

45
00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:34.820
and hide you away.

46
00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:36.560
So you won't have to see anyone anymore.

47
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.220
Are you trying to keep me captive?

48
00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.320
I want to treasure you.

49
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.660
Hmph.
